<title>Agentic AI Intervention Strategy — Follow-up Rigor on Unprocessed MSME-LAP Cases</title>
<style>
  :root{
    --navy:#1F3864; --blue:#2E75B6; --lblue:#DEEAF6; --orange:#C55A11; --lorange:#FBE5D6;
    --green:#538135; --lgreen:#E2EFD9; --red:#C00000; --lred:#FBE3E3; --grey:#595959;
    --bg:#F7F9FC; --card:#FFFFFF; --line:#E3E8F0; --ink:#1A2233;
